[00:13.69] Peace is a word
[00:15.56] Of the sea and the wind
[00:18.47] Peace is a bird who sings
[00:19.45] As you smile
[00:20.92] Peace is the love
[00:24.07] Of a foe as a friend
[00:28.71] Peace is the love you bring
[00:33.42] To a child
[00:39.64] Searching for me
[00:46.55] You look everywhere
[00:51.91] Except beside you
[00:55.65] Searching for you
[00:59.39] You look everywhere
[01:08.93] But not inside you
[01:15.26] Peace is a stream
[01:16.95] From the heart of a man
[01:20.59] Peace is a man whose breadth
[01:28.03] Is the dawn
[01:31.26] Peace is a dawn
[01:36.07] On a day without end
[01:40.75] Peace is the end like death
[01:46.06] Of the war
[01:53.00] 